{"name":"D.Mon","description":"MEKA의 새로운 부대장 D.Mon은 독보적인 게임 감각을 활용해 전투를 지휘하며, 어떤 위기에서도 팀을 하나로 단합시킵니다.","backgrounds":[{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt7ebd74c6809c3fd3/6a73d8a4a736253d5fc8a644/960_Dmon.png","sizes":["min","xs","sm"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltd3c87960c2414bdd/6a73d89ef42b958b982fa771/1600_Dmon.png","sizes":["md","lg"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt2543b5c043d434ed/6a73d8971bb9c51a0d6bc682/2600_Dmon.png","sizes":["xl+"]}],"portrait":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/a46c60b8562fdbd0b8308396d0808f7606fba208bc67cccf3f82fe56d2c73b9d.png","role":"tank","subrole":"stalwart","location":"대한민국 부산 MEKA 기지","birthday":"4월 21일","age":28,"hitpoints":{"shields":0,"health":425,"armor":275,"total":700},"abilities":[{"name":"플라스마 세이버 ","description":"빠른 에너지 근접 무기입니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/5b8ae7f23071c20d472d55243ddebe666c361bab598c18e12161b8415ee058de.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt472e52d23c6d191a/6a73de64458124cbbae14a74/plasmasaber.png","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt9fb75ef73b9da025/6a73e7e1458124d58ae14a7c/01_260727_DMon_WebAbilities_1P_PlasmaSaber_KG_0001.mp4","webm":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltafb4b78e2c2d80a0/6a73e7e85db6070a0dda4bd1/01_260727_DMon_WebAbilities_1P_PlasmaSaber_KG_0001.webm"}}},{"name":"휴대용 융합 연발총","description":"중기관총입니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/bedcca9c4d45135065757cd2f5ff48137b9694159ea5929959efa63e9a45dac7.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt27451ee96e3e81a3/6a73de7d71372ae9b52ebc39/portablefusionrepeater.png","link":{"mp4":"https://